{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "b2dd44ee-7d16-8c97-ae51-9ffbd9f60126",
  "created_at": "2026-01-30T15:56:15-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Jose Figueroa",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Lorraine Medeiros",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-30T15:54:05-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Lorraine. Good afternoon."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-30T15:54:08-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. Hello. I'm calling about a pothole. Well, it's a pothole and, uh, a sidewalk. Both. Both of them."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-30T15:54:15-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, I can help with that. Can I get the location?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-30T15:54:20-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "117 Malbone Road. In the North End. Right in front of the house, more or less."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-30T15:54:26-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "117 Malbone Road. Got it. Tell me about the pothole first."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-30T15:54:31-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's a big one. Deep. And right now it's full of water, so you can't see it. You cannot see how deep it is. I watched a delivery van drop right into it Tuesday. Bang."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-30T15:54:43-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh, that's no good. So it's filled with water and hard to see, right at the edge of the road there?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-30T15:54:51-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. Hard to see. Especially now, it gets dark so early. And the sidewalk, that's the other thing. It's heaved up. One slab is sticking up maybe two inches. I tripped on it. Tripped. Last weekend, coming back with the groceries."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-30T15:55:05-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'm sorry. Were you hurt?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-30T15:55:08-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, no. Bruised pride. But somebody's going to get hurt. Somebody older than me."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-30T15:55:13-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Understood. So that's a heaved sidewalk slab and a water-filled pothole, both at 117 Malbone Road."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-30T15:55:19-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's right. And I'd like the street put on the repair list. The list. I called about this last year, I think, and nothing. So please, add it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-30T15:55:29-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'll put in the request now and flag both items so the crew sees them. Can I confirm a callback number?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-30T15:55:37-05:00",
      "duration": 1,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "401-555-0189."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-30T15:55:38-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "401-555-0189. Thank you."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-30T15:55:40-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sorry, it's loud here. My son just got braces and he's complaining about them. Nonstop. He says his teeth hurt, and he wants soup. Only soup."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-30T15:55:49-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That first week is rough. Soft foods for a few days."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-30T15:55:54-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "So I hear. Anyway. The list. Malbone Road. Will somebody call me?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-30T15:55:59-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I can't give you a date, but the request will be in the system, and someone can reach out at that number if they need more details."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-30T15:56:09-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Fine. Thank you."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-30T15:56:11-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome, Mr. Figueroa. Have a good weekend."
    }
  ],
